  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVAtr">IV Atr</ref> 3.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Si tunc hominem invenire non possit cui dederit, reddat ipsum tolneum et persolvat et quinque libras regi.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If, however, he cannot produce the man to whom he paid it, he shall pay the actual toll and as much again and 5 pounds to the king.</ab>
      </div>
